/// `CM_notTEpsHom` (`NatPlusDeadEndOp2CatZ2`): dead-end object `*` (`none`) has rank
/// `nu_alt = 0 == nu_anchor` yet `in_deg_alt = 1 != 2 = in_deg_anchor`, so no
/// 2-automorphism maps `some 0` to `*` (`T-epsilon^{hom}` fails) while ALL 13 axioms
